Hi Till,

We spent the entire meeting discussing the FSG/OP action
item from OSDL DAM3 meeting to write a white paper that
analyzes the common print functionality in GTK+ and QT4
toolkits for possible inclusion in the Portland project.

Glen Petrie suggested that we expand the scope to ALL 
print api's (MS GDI, etc.) across all operating systems 
- this expanded scope should probably be in a second 
version of the white paper.

